13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165422913,"discussion_id":"4f945f60f7cd2c0933074bc0fa18036d50d31cb3","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化Im2col算子的内存访问安全性和计算效率。主要解决了输入缓冲区大小未按块对齐可能导致的数据访问越界问题，并针对无填充场景重构了输入数据加载方式，以提升内存访问的安全性和性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改包括：1) 引入`BLOCK_SIZE`常量并对输入缓冲区大小进行块对齐计算，确保内存访问不越界，并将硬编码的缓冲区元素数量计算统一为使用对齐后的`inputElemNum_`成员变量。2) 在`Init`函数中，根据`isPadding`模板参数条件化选择数据存储方式：有填充场景沿用`TBuf`缓冲区，无填充场景改用`TQue`队列进行管理，以优化数据流并减少不必要的内存拷贝。","created_at":"2026-03-16T20:29:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T20:29:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165423120,"discussion_id":"4812d6dd99ff77a27996fd80581a21fe9c1d5b2a","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-16T20:30:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T20:30:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165446036,"discussion_id":"fa06181f58503a28a953e158dace9820b8264d2f","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-17T08:56:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T08:56:38+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d30c60184036954b14e1","login":"pengyiming7","object_id":"6822d30c60184036954b14e1","name":"pengyi